    "updated_at": "2022-03-30T21:58:55Z",
    "body": "Just FYI:\r\n\r\nI have this as a `~/.aws/config` and starship does the right thing after setting `AWS_PROFILE=name`:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[profile xxx-bi]\r\nsso_start_url = https://xxx.awsapps.com/start/\r\nsso_region = eu-central-1\r\nsso_account_id = 1234567890\r\nsso_role_name = DevelopersRole\r\nregion = eu-central-1\r\noutput = json\r\n```\r\n\r\n(No default profile defined in `config`!)\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n~/projects/xxx on  master on ☁️  xxx-bi (eu-central-1) [🐳: local]\r\n[23:51:45] λ  starship --version\r\nstarship 1.5.4\r\n[...]\r\n\r\n~/projects/xxx on  master on ☁️  xxx-bi (eu-central-1) [🐳: local]\r\n[23:52:04] λ  env |grep AWS\r\nAWS_PROFILE=xxx-bi\r\n```\r\n\r\n@simonweil So what is different in your setup?\r\n\r\n(@davidkna BTW, thanks for getting this back to work! :-))",
